             so the bare [apply] never fired and [try] swallowed it, leaving the
             side goal open -- which is what "Proof is not complete." reports here.
             No statement changes; this is the direction, not the fact. *)
          by (f_equal; try (unfold wa; first [reflexivity | f_equal; lia]);
              try (first [apply le1_lit | symmetry; apply le1_lit]));
        pose proof (u8arr_write rsegs mm buf bs len (Z_to_bv 8 v) BU ltac:(lia)) as BU';
